---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="首页">
  <div class="home-page">
    <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="intro-column">
        <p class="eyebrow">个人主页 · 学习资料库</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">你好，我是 pmt2018。</h1>
        <p class="identity">学生 / 助教 / 算法与编程学习者</p>
        <div class="portrait-slot" aria-label="未来可放置头像的位置">portrait / photo</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bio-column">
        <p class="bio-lead">我在这里整理教学材料、算法笔记，以及那些值得长期保留的学习记录。</p>
        <p>目前主要关注南京大学 Problem Solving 课程中的编程教学，也持续记录数据结构、图和动态规划等主题。希望这些内容既能帮助正在学习的同学，也能成为自己日后查阅的可靠索引。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">更多关于我 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <nav class="home-links" aria-label="内容入口">
      <a href="/teaching/"><strong>Teaching</strong><span>课程材料与编程实践</span></a>
      <a href="/algorithms/"><strong>Algorithms</strong><span>按主题整理的算法笔记</span></a>
      <a href="/notes/"><strong>Notes</strong><span>长期积累的参考内容</span></a>
    </nav>

    <section class="now-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
        <h2 id="now-title">最近在做什么</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="now-list">
        <li><span class="now-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>整理 NJU Problem Solving 的课程材料与 OJ 讲解。</span></li>
        <li><span class="now-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>补充图论、动态规划和基础数据结构笔记。</span></li>
        <li><span class="now-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>让这份资料库保持清晰、可读，也方便自己以后查找。</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
